Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add SABIC quarterly income statements 2021-2025 and
 dividend-adjusted closes

2023-2025: statement-of-income lines transcribed from each quarterly report on
sabic.com (scanned pages), with prior-year columns as re-presented; every period checked
(revenue + cost of sales = gross profit, quarters add to the year-to-date column, net
income equal across original and re-presented columns). 2021-2022: the engine reader's
output, net income cross-checked; one OCR scale fix in Q1 2022. Prices gain the feed's
dividend-adjusted close.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CfTpoii6QDStyTPdotmEdY
