Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Add total return from a single dividend-adjusted price
 series

total_return_1y/3y/5y/10y = latest adjusted close / adjusted close on or before the
horizon - 1, with the market-return session-gap rule; both ends must come from the same
archived series, since a feed rescales its adjusted closes at every new dividend.

